        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Micro-frameworks leave routing, database, sessions, queues, and templating to fragmented third-party libraries that break on every major Node.js upgrade. BirFramework delivers a cohesive standard.
        </p>
