          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">Persistent V8 Memory</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Unlike PHP-FPM or serverless functions that boot the runtime on every single request, BirFramework stays warm in V8 memory, serving responses in under 2ms.
          </p>
        </div>

